  // words a model knows rather than in shader parameters it does not.
  gel: `Toko Drop house style. Translucent coloured gel and hard candy-glass.
Soft subsurface scattering, a wet clearcoat highlight, faint internal glow.
Rounded squat forms with weight, sitting on the ground rather than floating.
Clean studio lighting on a plain dark backdrop, no text, no logos, no UI.`,

  // Hyper Dagger: black and white with dark red as the ONLY contrast colour.
  // Stated that way in CLAUDE.md and it is load-bearing — a second hue in a
  // reference plate is what starts the drift.
